  "fcf": "<p><strong>QUESTION: IF A QUESTION IS NOT ON HERE?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE: PLEASE REFER THE CONSUMER TO THE CORRESPONDING \"800\" NUMBER: 866-559-0287</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>WHO ARE THE FFCF</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE: THE FFCF WAS FOUNDED IN 1991  and is a not for-profit 501(c)3 organization that pro-vides direct aid to victims of fire or disaster, other nonprofit agencies, and volunteer fire departments. FFCF is not a union or a representative of individual firefighters or their departments.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: ARE YOU A MEMBER OF THE ORGANIZATION?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE:NO, I WORK FOR GOOD MERITS INC A PROFESSIONAL FUNDRAISING COMPANY WHICH HAS BEEN CONTRACTED BY THE FOUNDATION.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: WHAT IS THE TAX STATUS OF THIS ORGANIZATION?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE: THE FFCF IS DESIGNATED BY THE IRS AS A 501(C)(3) NON-PROFIT CHARITABLE ORGANIZATION.  YOUR CONTRIBUTION MAY BE TAX DEDUCTIBLE, HOWEVER WE SUGGEST YOU CONSULT YOUR TAX PREPARER.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: WHERE IS THE ORGANIZATION LOCATED?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE: THE FIREFIGHTERS CHARITABLE FOUNDATION IS HEADQUARTERED IN FARMINGDALE NY.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: DO THEY HAVE A WEBSITE?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE: YOU CAN VISIT THEM ON THE WEB AT WWW.FFCF.ORG</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: HOW MUCH GOES TO THE ORGANIZATION?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE: OUR INSTRUCTIONS ARE TO TELL EVERYONE A MINIMUM OF 15% GOES TO THE CAUSE, HOWEVER PLEASE CALL THE TOLL FREE # WHICH IS 866-991-9415 FOR MORE INFORMATION.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: DOES THIS HELP OUT LOCALLY?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE:THIS IS A NATIONAL DRIVE.</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><strong>QUESTION: WHO DO YOU WORK FOR?</strong><br />\r\n        RESPONSE:I WORK FOR GOOD MERITS HEADQUARTERED AT 8 THE GREEN SUITE 8514 DOVER DE 19901</p>",
